    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπᾰτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trample under foot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.84
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑσὶ τὸ σπέρμα κ</span>.
				<i>trample down</i> the seed (i.e. <i>have</i> it
				<i>trampled down</i>) by swine, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.173
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				34.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐγκέφαλον ἐν ταῖς πτέρναις
					-πεπατημένον φορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ δ᾽ ὅρκια πιστὰ πάτησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.157
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοὺς νόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					714a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γράμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					484a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν υἱὸν τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					10.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					14.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
